# 1.8V Simple NMOS Amplifier

A complete transistor-level NMOS Amplifier design. The circuit receives a weak 1kHz sine with 10mV Amplitude, amplifies it with 20dB gain (100mV Amplitude). 

All simulations and validations were performed in **LTspice**.

## Key Specifications

| Parameter | Value / Description |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Technology** | Generic CMOS Vth=0.5V Kp=200u Lambda=0.02 (W/L) = (2u/1u) |
| **Supply Voltage (VDD)** | 1.8V |
| **Virtual Ground / DC Bias** | 0V |
| **Input Signal Amplitude** | 10mV |
| **Carrier Frequency** | 100kHz |
| **Current** | 8μΑ |
| **Resistor** | 138kΩ |
| **Load Capacitor** | 1pF |
| **Bandwidth** | 0 - 1.37 MHz |
| **Midband Gain** | 20dB|


